        "h": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "358:164",
        "text": "I started with quick hand sketches to rapidly explore navigation patterns, screen hierarchy, and interaction flows before committing to digital wireframes. This helped evaluate multiple concepts early while keeping the focus on solving the problem rather than refining visuals.",
